A single FUND purchase paid in SEK has an unambiguous acquisition cost.

========== CLI ==========

ledlight transactions --format text

========== FILE ==========

commodity SEK
  default
  format 1,000.00 SEK
commodity FUND
  format 1,000 FUND
account Assets:Fund
account Assets:Cash

2024-01-01 Purchase without a lot cost
  Assets:Fund  4 FUND
  Assets:Cash  -400 SEK

========== OUTPUT ==========

2024-01-01 Purchase without a lot cost
    Assets:Fund                         4 FUND {100.00 SEK}
    Assets:Cash                          -400.00 SEK

========== WARNINGS ==========

